OL,5,Adismissed
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge says he will consider the
OL,8,Fdefence's request to fully dismiss the
OL,9,Fcase in a new hearing on 2 November
OL,11,FClancy, 36, has admitted killing her
OL,12,Fchildren, but she pleaded not guilty to
OL,13,Fmurder, arguing she had postpartum
OL,14,Fpsychosis at the time ` who were Cora,
OL,15,FDawson and Callan?
